			(property "Description" "Generic connector, single row, 01x04 -- reused for: (a) the 4-pin fan header (1=+12V_FAN 2=GND 3=PWM(shared FAN_PWM) 4=TACH, per-header individual TACH bit into the 74HC165 poll chain); (b) the bimetal de-gate backstop header (1=DEGATE_DRIVE 2=DEGATE_RAIL, in series through the remote plate-mounted 120C thermal switch chain -- ANY open switch de-gates regardless of MCU state; 3/4 spare for a second independent bimetal loop). Per-instance pin map documented at each use site (gen_tester_st.py)."
